"g":13.3},{"n":24,"t":"Ev dedikleri şeyin kafesten ne farkı var ki? Özgürlük bu değil!","d":4.71,"g":13.5},{"n":25,"t":"Gel buraya!","d":1.21,"g":13.9},{"n":26,"t":"Şimdi ikile!","d":1.6,"g":14.3},{"n":27,"t":"Bu nasılmış he!?","d":1.44,"g":12.7},{"n":28,"t":"Uğraşma benimle!","d":1.49,"g":12.2},{"n":29,"t":"Haha! Çok zayıfsın!","d":2.28,"g":12.4},{"n":30,"t":"Yakala!","d":1.33,"g":10.5},{"n":31,"t":"Dans zamanı~","d":1.67,"g":11.1},{"n":32,"t":"Kaçamazsınn! He he!","d":2.48,"g":12.3},{"n":33,"t":"Yakaladım ki!","d":1.51,"g":13.4},{"n":34,"t":"Ruhum... artık... özgür...","d":3.07,"g":17.4},{"n":35,"t":"Ama bu çok barizdi!","d":2.2,"g":13.1},{"n":36,"t":"Umm? Bu kadarcık mıydı?","d":2.18,"g":13.3},{"n":37,"t":"Hiç üzülmeyeceğim! O bunu hak etti!","d":2.85,"g":14.0},{"n":38,"t":"Başkalarına aldırış etmeyi bırak! Kendin ol.","d":3.46,"g":13.4},{"n":39,"t":"Artık özgürsün, ebediyen özgür.","d":3.29,"g":14.2},{"n":40,"t":"Benimle geliyorsun küçük hanım!","d":2.06,"g":12.8}],"ru":[{"n":1,"t":"Я тебя никому не отдам~","d":2.07,"g":12.0},{"n":2,"t":"Хватит! Получить хочешь?!","d":3.82,"g":11.8},{"n":3,"t":"Так-так... Никого нет... Дай-ка... Ох!.. Кхм!","d":6.75,"g":13.0},{"n":4,"t":"Стоп! Что случилось... Ах! Вот она!","d":5.5,"g":9.4},{"n":5,"t":"Свобода! Ха-ха-ха!","d":2.16,"g":12.9},{"n":6,"t":"Давай оцифруем весь мир!","d":2.53,"g":13.2},{"n":7,"t":"Отличный апдейт!","d":1.71,"g":13.0},{"n":8,"t":"Еще один тест!","d":1.61,"g":13.4},{"n":9,"t":"Я снова онлайн!","d":1.54,"g":12.9},{"n":10,"t":"А? Неизвестная ошибка?","d":2.84,"g":10.8},{"n":11,"t":"Классно выглядит!","d":1.58,"g":13.2},{"n":12,"t":"Юху!","d":1.22,"g":14.7},{"n":13,"t":"Барьер снят!","d":1.76,"g":12.4},{"n":14,"t":"Устранять проблемы, мой конек!","d":2.54,"g":12.2},{"n":15,"t":"Рассвет обязательно наступит!","d":2.62,"g":12.5},{"n":16,"t":"Пока свободен мой разум.","d":1.95,"g":12.6},{"n":17,"t":"До свободы рукой подать!","d":2.35,"g":13.0},{"n":18,"t":"Мы, \"Претенденты\", обо всем позаботимся!","d":2.98,"g":12.2},{"n":19,"t":"Нет... Я не чья-то марионетка! Это не так!","d":3.87,"g":13.0},{"n":20,"t":"Они так долго носили маски, что забыли, кто они на самом деле!","d":4.38,"g":11.5},{"n":21,"t":"Мы с ней, такие разные... Но так и должно быть.","d":5.49,"g":10.1},{"n":22,"t":"Не могу больше сдерживаться!","d":2.35,"g":12.9},{"n":23,"t":"Какой бы путь я не выбрала, он ведет к свободе!","d":3.77,"g":12.7},{"n":24,"t":"Для меня дом, как золотая клетка для птички.","d":4.01,"g":12.7},{"n":25,"t":"Иди сюда!","d":1.24,"g":13.6},{"n":26,"t":"Прочь!","d":0.97,"g":15.5},{"n":27,"t":"А если так?!","d":1.39,"g":13.2},{"n":28,"t":"Не смей со мной шутить!","d":2.09,"g":13.0},{"n":29,"t":"Ха! Силенок маловато!","d":2.57,"g":12.8},{"n":30,"t":"Получай!","d":1.36,"g":13.8},{"n":31,"t":"Время танцевать!","d":1.61,"g":13.1},{"n":32,"t":"Меня ищешь?","d":1.43,"g":13.9},{"n":33,"t":"Не туда!","d":1.1,"g":13.2},{"n":34,"t":"Так... близко...","d":2.66,"g":11.8},{"n":35,"t":"Этого следовало ожидать!","d":1.91,"g":13.1},{"n":36,"t":"И все?","d":1.1,"g":13.7},{"n":37,"t":"По заслугам!","d":1.43,"g":12.9},{"n":38,"t":"Не оглядывайся! Иди вперед и будь собой.","d":3.7,"g":13.3},{"n":39,"t":"Ты свободна. Навсегда.","d":2.59,"g":13.4},{"n":40,"t":"Я забираю тебя домой!","d":2.05,"g":12.4}],"jp":[{"n":1,"t":"離さないんだから","tr":"I'm never letting go of you!","d":2.23,"g":-8.4},{"n":2,"t":"やめっ、痛い目に遭いたいの、ふっ","tr":"Stop it! Do you want to get hurt? Heh.","d":3.56,"g":-7.1},{"n":3,"t":"よし、誰もいない、ふふふ、あっ、うんうん","tr":"Okay, nobody's around. Hehe... oh! ...Ahem.","d":5.86,"g":-1.8},{"n":4,"t":"えっ、何が起きたの、あった","tr":"Huh...? What happened? Found it!","d":5.19,"g":-6.9},{"n":5,"t":"自由だ、あははは","tr":"Freedom! Hahaha!","d":2.71,"g":-4.9},{"n":6,"t":"プログラミングの世界へ","tr":"Into the world of programming!","d":1.73,"g":-5.7},{"n":7,"t":"完璧なアップデート","tr":"A perfect update!","d":1.99,"g":-5.8},{"n":8,"t":"再テスト開始","tr":"Starting the retest!","d":1.77,"g":-6.1},{"n":9,"t":"すぐ戻るからね","tr":"I'll be right back.","d":1.89,"g":-7.1},{"n":10,"t":"原因不明エラー","tr":"Unknown error.","d":1.72,"g":-6.8},{"n":11,"t":"どう、これ見て","tr":"How's that? Look at this.","d":2.42,"g":-5.3},{"n":12,"t":"いいねぇ","tr":"Nice.","d":1.58,"g":-5.7},{"n":13,"t":"障害の排除完了","tr":"Obstacle removal complete.","d":2.16,"g":-7.0},{"n":14,"t":"トラブルシューティングは得意なのよね","tr":"I'm good at troubleshooting, you know.","d":3.03,"g":-6.1},{"n":15,"t":"ついに夜明けがやってくる","tr":"The dawn is finally coming.","d":1.94,"g":-6.5},{"n":16,"t":"私はどんなルールにも縛られない","tr":"I'm not bound by any rules.","d":2.69,"g":-7.0},{"n":17,"t":"ふふん、誰も私の自由は邪魔できない","tr":"Heh. No one can get in the way of my freedom.","d":4.27,"g":-5.4},{"n":18,"t":"自分がやるべきことは、責任を持って最後までやるよ","tr":"What I'm supposed to do, I'll see through to the end, responsibly.","d":4.61,"g":-4.9},{"n":19,"t":"違う、私は誰かの操り人形じゃない","tr":"No... I'm not anyone's puppet.","d":4.29,"g":-5.3},{"n":20,"t":"長い間自分を偽っていると、本当の自分を見失うものよ","tr":"If you disguise yourself for long enough, you lose sight of who you really are.","d":6.12,"g":-3.6},{"n":21,"t":"あの子と私は違う、似ても似つかない","tr":"She and I are different. Nothing alike.","d":3.7,"g":-2.3},{"n":22,"t":"うーん、もうこれ以上我慢できない","tr":"Mmm, I can't hold it back any longer.","d":4.21,"g":-5.4},{"n":23,"t":"どの道を行こうとも、自由を諦めるつもりはないよ","tr":"Whichever road I take, I won't give up my freedom.","d":4.69,"g":-6.0},{"n":24,"t":"私にとって家は、金の鳥かごみたいなもの","tr":"To me, home is like a golden birdcage.","d":4.81,"g":-4.2},{"n":25,"t":"来い","tr":"Come here!","d":0.56,"g":-5.3},{"n":26,"t":"消えちゃえ","tr":"Disappear!","d":0.97,"g":-6.0},{"n":27,"t":"これはどう","tr":"How about this?","d":1.04,"g":-7.0},{"n":28,"t":"邪魔しないで","tr":"Don't get in my way!","d":1.24,"g":-5.8},{"n":29,"t":"弱い弱い","tr":"Weak, weak.","d":2.55,"g":-6.5},{"n":30,"t":"くらえ","tr":"Take this!","d":0.95,"g":-6.9},{"n":31,"t":"踊りましょう","tr":"Let's dance!","d":1.79,"g":-7.6},{"n":32,"t":"私とやるの","tr":"You want to take me on?","d":1.47,"g":-6.4},{"n":33,"t":"そっちじゃないよ","tr":"Not that way.","d":2.09,"g":-6.0},{"n":34,"t":"あと、少しなのに","tr":"Just... a little more...","d":3.54,"g":-0.5},{"n":35,"t":"当然の結果ね","tr":"That's only to be expected.","d":1.81,"g":-6.1},{"n":36,"t":"それで終わりなの","tr":"Is that all?","d":1.82,"g":-5.4},{"n":37,"t":"自業自得ね","tr":"You brought it on yourselves.","d":2.04,"g":-6.7},{"n":38,"t":"自分を操るのは自分、どうするかは、自分で決めていいの","tr":"You're the one who controls yourself. What to do is yours to decide.","d":6.34,"g":-5.4},{"n":39,"t":"これで自由ね、永遠に","tr":"Now you're free. Forever.","d":3.16,"g":-5.2},{"n":40,"t":"お家に帰りましょう","tr":"Let's go home.","d":1.46,"g":-6.7}]},"full":{"id":"voice-ruby-full","m4a":"voicelines/ruby/full.m4a","d":189.52,"note":"All 40 lines of Ruby in one recording, in order.","g":0.1},"trailer":[{"id":"voice-trailer-01","n":1,"t":"アンジェラ、やめて！","tr":"Angela, stop!","who":"Ruby","d":1.46,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/01.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/01.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":26.2,"note":"No official translation.","g":-8.9},{"id":"voice-trailer-02","n":2,"t":"ルビーよ、覚えてる？","tr":"I'm Ruby! Don't you remember?","who":"Ruby","d":1.85,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/02.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/02.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":44.29,"note":"No official translation.","g":-6.8},{"id":"voice-trailer-03","n":3,"t":"ずっと一緒にいたのよ。","tr":"We had been together since the very beginning!","who":"Ruby","d":1.72,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/03.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/03.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":47.38,"note":"No official translation.","g":-6.5},{"id":"voice-trailer-04","n":4,"t":"痛い？","tr":"Does it hurt?","who":"Ruby","d":0.74,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/04.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/04.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":55.55,"note":"No official translation.","g":-4.5},{"id":"voice-trailer-06","n":6,"t":"こんなの嫌！あなたを犠牲にした自由なんて欲しくない！","tr":"I don't want you to be like this! I don't want freedom at the cost of you!","who":"Ruby","d":4.35,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/06.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/06.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":71.32,"note":"No official translation.","g":-7.8},{"id":"voice-trailer-07","n":7,"t":"起きて、アンジェラ！","tr":"Wake up, Angela!","who":"Ruby","d":1.81,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/07.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/07.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":77.48,"note":"No official translation.","g":-8.2},{"id":"voice-trailer-08","n":8,"t":"どうして、こんなこと……","tr":"How did we end up like this...","who":"Ruby","d":1.55,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/08.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/08.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":84.1,"note":"No official translation.","g":-4.3},{"id":"voice-trailer-13","n":13,"t":"奴らさえ消えれば……","tr":"If it wasn't for all of this...","who":"Ruby","d":2.06,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/13.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/13.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":104.14,"note":"No official translation.","g":-7.0},{"id":"voice-trailer-14","n":14,"t":"奴らさえ消えれば！","tr":"If it wasn't for all of this...","who":"Angry Ruby","d":2.11,"m4a":"voicelines/trailer/14.m4a","flac":"voicelines/trailer/14.flac","film":"film-ruby-and-angela-video-trailer-trailer-final","at":135.09,"note":"No official translation.","g":-7.4}]}
